Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:41.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西班牙 毕尔包）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.07,0:00:45.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（瑞士工业银行）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 谢谢你百忙之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}So good of you to come see me, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.78,0:00:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能抽空赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Particularly on such short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.85,0:00:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果信不过瑞士银行家 这世界会变成什么样子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf you can't trust a Swiss banker, what's the world come to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.38,0:01:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然大家都准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now that we're all comfortable…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.05,0:01:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…why don't you sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我费了点工夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not easy…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.06,0:01:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于拿回钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I have retrieved the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯爵士一定会很高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No doubt Sir Robert will be pleased to see it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.50,0:01:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,以目前的汇率来计算 扣掉手续费\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the current rate of exchange, minus the fees and certain…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.87,0:01:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一些额外费用\N{\fnArial\fs30}…unforeseeable expenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是收据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voila, the receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.97,0:01:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要过目吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to check my figures?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.78,0:01:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定数字是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure they're perfectly rounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.21,0:01:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.92,0:01:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是为钱来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't come for the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯爵士买的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}The report Sir Robert bought was stolen…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.99,0:01:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从一个为它而死的 情报员手中偷来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from an Ml6 agent who was killed for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.66,0:01:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道凶手是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know who killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真惨 - 我只要名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Terrible tragedy. - I just want a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.30,0:01:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是中间人 把钱归还原主\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am merely the middleman. I'm trying to do the honorable thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.07,0:01:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是很有良心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…returning the money to its rightful owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.70,0:01:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对瑞士银行家来说 是多不简单的事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know how difficult that can be for a Swiss banker.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.05,0:02:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你机会把钱带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am offering you the opportunity to walk out with the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.28,0:02:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你机会把命留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm giving you the opportunity to walk out with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.95,0:02:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,照目前的情况看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking at our present situation…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为一个银行家 我得说你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as a banker, I'd have to say…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,说这种狠话的本钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that the numbers are not on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.23,0:02:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你没有看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you failed to take into account…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.73,0:02:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我潜在的资本\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my hidden assets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.78,0:02:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是我占上风\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've had a small reversal of fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.01,0:02:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把名字说出来 - 办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me the name. - I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们数到三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's count to three.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.75,0:02:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定办得到 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do that, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.79,0:02:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你得保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'll have to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:37.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伦敦 MI6情报总局）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有带礼物送我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you brought me a souvenir from your trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧克力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chocolates?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,订婚戒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}An engagement ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定喜欢这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd enjoy one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真浪漫\N{\fnArial\fs30}How romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.89,0:05:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道该放哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly where to put that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.03,0:05:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我俩的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}The story of our relationship:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.11,0:05:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,食之无味 弃之可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close, but no cigar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.91,0:05:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰了 007 请你进来一下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to tear you away from affairs of state. Would you mind coming in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上来 M夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away, M.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.42,0:05:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯金恩爵士 这是詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Robert King, James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.49,0:05:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我找回我的钱 谢谢 干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man who retrieved my money. Thank you. Excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.19,0:05:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要小心 M夫人 我可能会把他挖走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful, M. I might steal him from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.39,0:05:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,建筑不是我的专长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Construction's not exactly my specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 他是专门搞破坏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite the opposite, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我问候你家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best to the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,老朋友吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在牛津一起念法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}We read law at Oxford together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.98,0:05:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就知道他会称霸天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always knew he'd conquer the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.11,0:05:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要喝一杯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Care for a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:05:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的为人很有原则\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a man of great integrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.29,0:06:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,却花三百万英镑 买失窃报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who buys stolen reports for 3 million pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.02,0:06:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有狙击手的线索吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any leads on the sniper?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.33,0:06:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是职业高手做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professional job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.93,0:06:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定受人指使\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must be working for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是失窃报告？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this the stolen report? - Yes. Classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,从苏俄原子能源部来的 机密文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the Russian Atomic Energy Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,金恩要这个干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would King want this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为这项秘密报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was led to believe the document was a secret report…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.31,0:06:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,指认了个一直在破坏 他新的输油管的恐怖份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…identifying the terrorists who'd attacked his new oil pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.38,0:06:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.98,0:06:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这没解释为什么有人救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't explain why someone would want me out of their office alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,金恩！那笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}King! The money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.87,0:06:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦妮 拦住金恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moneypenny, stop King.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:06:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.22,0:07:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.77,0:07:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:07:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还没完成呢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.14,0:13:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么？- 放开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you think you're… - Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.54,0:13:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.34,0:13:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我合作 说出背后主使\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make a deal. Tell me who's behind this…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.28,0:13:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你替谁工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who you work for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把我们炸死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't blow us up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.62,0:13:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？谁也不能伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand? I can protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.29,0:13:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就能！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.00,0:14:32.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之黑日危机》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女孩是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that young woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.91,0:17:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,金恩的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}King's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.05,0:17:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉翠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elektra.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.88,0:17:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.82,0:17:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,钞票浸过尿素\N{\fnArial\fs30}The money was dipped in urea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,威力强大的肥料炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}A highly compacted fertilizer bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,007的手碰过钞票 又摸到冰块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having handled the money, the water on 007's hands…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是引起化学反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when he touched the ice, started a chemical reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.93,0:17:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一张钞票的反伪造金属线 被换成镁制引信\N{\fnArial\fs30}In one note, the anti-counterfeiting strip was replaced with magnesium…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,金恩的胸针\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which acted as a detonator. And King's lapel pin…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.61,0:18:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也被换成\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was switched for a copy…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆炸药的无线电发送器\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which contained a radio transmitter to trigger the blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,换句话说 他引爆炸弹炸死自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In other words, he set off the bomb that killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道凶手是金恩的亲信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know it was someone close to King…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.25,0:18:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的线索却 在气球上自杀身亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and our only lead committed suicide on that balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.46,0:18:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,金恩企业规模如此庞大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But given the size of King's organization…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.83,0:18:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,想找出凶手 简直就是海底捞针\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it could be anyone, anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.03,0:18:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不能饶过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will not stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让一个懦夫 利用我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't be terrorized by cowards who'd murder an innocent man…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.37,0:18:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,残杀无辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and use us as the tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.07,0:18:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要找出凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find those who committed this atrocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.28,0:18:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算追到天涯海角\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll follow them to the farthest ends of the earth, if needs be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也要将他们绳之以法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will bring them to justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谭纳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tanner!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,M夫人说你不能参与行动 除非得到医生批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}M says you're off the active-duty list until you're cleared by medical.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.31,0:19:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁骨脱臼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dislocated collarbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.14,0:19:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是扯断韧带 你就得休养好几星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}If any more tendons snap, I'm afraid you'll be out of action for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.35,0:19:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一张健康证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I need a clean bill of health.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.99,0:19:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得给我出健康证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to clear me for duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.76,0:19:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是很不… - 道德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That wouldn't really be… - Ethical?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.16,0:19:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际\N{\fnArial\fs30}Practical.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.70,0:19:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.83,0:19:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉点裙带关系吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…skirt the issue, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你一定要打电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd have to promise to call me…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.58,0:19:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.21,0:19:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大夫命令 不敢不从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever the doctor orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.45,0:19:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你有持久的耐力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose if you stayed in constant contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.85,0:19:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有足够的体力\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you showed sufficient stamina…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.42,0:20:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要做任何… - 剧烈运动？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …cut out all kinds of… - Strenuous activity?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.91,0:20:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种音乐真的很霹雳 对吧 Q先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose we all have to pay the piper sometime, right, Q?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.38,0:20:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 少罗唆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, pipe down, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.39,0:20:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得罪你了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it something I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 只是你毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Something you destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.03,0:20:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fishing boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.93,0:20:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算退休以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my retirement…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.63,0:20:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,离你远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}…away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.57,0:20:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,介绍你个小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I want to introduce you to the young fellow…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我的接班人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm grooming to follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,门打开会比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helps to open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.85,0:21:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you might be…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.29,0:21:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是007\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.39,0:21:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是Q先生 他一定是R先生了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're Q, does that make him R?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,007情报员果然机智过人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the legendary 007 wit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.86,0:21:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是英雄无用武之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.50,0:21:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢保证你一定会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I dare say, 007, that you've met…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这辆车很满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your match with this machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,全新车款？更健全的配备？\N{\fnArial\fs30}New model? Improved specs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是受伤休养吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were on the inactive roster. Some injury?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆车有最先进的反制武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I was saying, the very latest in interception countermeasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.98,0:21:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,钛合金车体 多功能显示荧幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Titanium armor, a multitasking heads-up display…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个饮料杯座\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and six beverage cup holders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.06,0:21:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说是应有尽有\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in all, rather stocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是“配备齐全”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Fully loaded, " I think is the term.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想… - 你在这不能想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think… - You're not here to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.47,0:21:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这只能听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here to do what I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.47,0:21:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,去把外套穿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, go put on the coat…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.27,0:21:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为007示范一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and demonstrate it for 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.24,0:22:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 你要仔细看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now watch closely, please, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.31,0:22:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,右手伸入右袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The right arm goes in the right sleeve, thus…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.95,0:22:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,左手伸入左袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the left arm in the left sleeve, thus.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.62,0:22:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细看 上面有口袋、拉链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Note closely, please: pockets, poppers and zipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.76,0:22:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把拉链的下方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the lower part of the zipper…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.19,0:22:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,插入正确的位置…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and insert it into…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.79,0:22:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就扯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull the tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.03,0:22:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.64,0:22:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经整装待发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems well-suited for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.87,0:22:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会这么早退休\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not retiring anytime soon…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.58,0:22:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.81,0:22:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 仔细听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, pay attention, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.91,0:22:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想教你两件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always tried to teach you two things:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.35,0:22:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 别向敌人露出弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, never let them see you bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.02,0:22:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the second?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.86,0:22:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要知道如何逃命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always have an escape plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.26,0:22:56.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗伯金恩爵士接手伊苏密）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 伊莉翠绑案已结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening. The Elektra King kidnap ordeal is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.64,0:23:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方说她射杀两名匪徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cyprus authorities say she has escaped…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.25,0:23:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功逃出歹徒手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}…after shooting dead two of her captors and is…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.65,0:23:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对我大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shouted.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.46,0:23:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直大吼大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouted all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.01,0:23:36.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（五百万美金）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.48,0:23:49.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（兑换三百万英镑）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.36,0:23:56.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（汇率）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.33,0:24:04.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（三百万英镑）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.04,0:24:06.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（兑换五百万美金）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.78,0:24:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要一级特准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Level one clearance required.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.41,0:24:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要一级特准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Level one clearance required.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.69,0:24:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事 007？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, 007?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.52,0:24:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我谈谈伊莉翠的绑案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about the kidnapping of Elektra King.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.19,0:24:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你参与此案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't aware you had an assignment on this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.79,0:24:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带回来的那些钱杀了金恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought the money in that killed King.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.46,0:24:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要觉得太内疚 - 我没有 你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't make this personal. - I'm not. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.80,0:24:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你能封锁她的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one who could seal her file.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.08,0:24:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,容我们失陪一下可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you excuse us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.38,0:24:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能容许你抗命行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not tolerate insubordination, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.29,0:25:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.56,0:25:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉翠遭到绑架后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Elektra King was kidnapped…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.27,0:25:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他父亲想私下解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}…her father tried to deal with it on his own…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.84,0:25:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但徒劳无功\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with no success.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.51,0:25:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是他来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.15,0:25:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们不向 恐怖份子妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you are aware, we do not negotiate with terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.66,0:25:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我不顾我的直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And against every instinct in my heart…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.36,0:25:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的母性\N{\fnArial\fs30}…every emotion as a mother…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.37,0:25:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫他不要付赎金\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I told him not to pay the ransom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.20,0:25:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为时间很充裕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had time on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.61,0:25:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把她当诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used the girl as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.25,0:25:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那笔钱的金额\N{\fnArial\fs30}The money in King's briefcase was the same amount…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.08,0:26:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟莉莉翠的赎金等值\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as the ransom demand for his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.49,0:26:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.26,0:26:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个恐怖份子又出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your terrorist is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.07,0:26:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,维特苏卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor Zokas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.81,0:26:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别号是\N{\fnArial\fs30}A.k.a…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.17,0:26:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.54,0:26:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,无政府主义份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The anarchist.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.81,0:26:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,1996年他在莫斯科行动 之前在北韩平壤活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was operating in Moscow in 1996. Pyongyang, North Korea before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.11,0:26:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也曾出没在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's been spotted…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.68,0:26:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿富汗、伊拉克、伊朗 贝鲁特、高棉\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in Afghanistan, Bosnia, Iraq, Iran, Beirut and Cambodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.92,0:26:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是浪漫的渡假胜地\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the romantic vacation spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.46,0:26:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他唯一的目的是天下大乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}His only goal is chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.69,0:26:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯来找我后 我派009去刺杀雷纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Robert came to me, I sent 009 to kill Renard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.73,0:26:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但计划还没完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he completed the mission…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.73,0:26:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉翠先逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Elektra escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.97,0:26:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一星期后 我们的人找到雷纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}A week later, our man caught up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.57,0:26:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,向他脑袋开一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He put a bullet in his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.70,0:26:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹至今还留在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bullet's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.31,0:26:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么能活下来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.21,0:27:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,救了他的医生无法取出子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor who saved Renard couldn't get the bullet out…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.91,0:27:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷纳就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so Renard killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.61,0:27:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹崁入脑髓 阻断他所有的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's moving through the medulla oblongata, killing off his senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.15,0:27:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括触觉 嗅觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touch, smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.79,0:27:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也感觉不到痛楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He feels no pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.39,0:27:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的体力和耐力比常人强\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can push himself harder, longer than any normal man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.99,0:27:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹还是会致命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bullet will kill him…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.89,0:27:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在死前 他会越来越强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but he'll grow stronger every day until the day he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.17,0:27:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robert is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.70,0:27:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,MI6丢了面子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ml6 is humiliated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.14,0:27:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经报了大仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's had his revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.41,0:27:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.58,0:27:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷纳有三个仇人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renard had three enemies in that kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.21,0:27:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's still one he hasn't touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.12,0:27:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉翠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elektra.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.59,0:27:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生批准你出任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the good doctor has cleared you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.93,0:27:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你有过人的体力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Notes you have exceptional stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.17,0:27:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定是对这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure she was touched by his dedication…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.60,0:28:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有亲身的体验\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to the job in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.57,0:28:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你去保护伊莉翠\N{\fnArial\fs30}007, I want you to go to Elektra.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.41,0:28:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她继承父业 在架设输油管\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's taken over the construction of her father's oil pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.45,0:28:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出更换胸针的内贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find who switched that pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.85,0:28:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的直觉是对的 雷纳会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your instincts are right, Renard will be back…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.05,0:28:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个目标就是伊莉翠\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and Elektra will be the next target.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.72,0:28:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她又要当诱饵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worm on the hook again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.32,0:28:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不需要知道 同一个人想杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't need to know the same man may be after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.33,0:28:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把她吓坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't frighten her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.96,0:28:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算是卧底行动？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shadow operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.90,0:28:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.36,0:28:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能卧底查案\N{\fnArial\fs30}…shadows stay in front or behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.27,0:28:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能卧到她床上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.77,0:28:37.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（亚塞拜然）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.10,0:29:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得回去 这地方被封锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, go back. Leave. This area is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.07,0:29:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来见伊莉翠金恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to see Elektra King.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.14,0:29:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德 环球贸易公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond, Universal Exports.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.51,0:29:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是安全主任大卫朵夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm Davidov, chief of security.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.07,0:29:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以看到村民 正在示威抗议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're having problems with the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.91,0:29:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请金小姐留在巴库的公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've told Miss King to stay at the office in Baku.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.05,0:29:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.64,0:30:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金小姐 我请你别来的 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss King, I told you to… - I know what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.85,0:31:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把油管得绕过这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send the pipe around.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.22,0:31:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会多花时间和多花几百万元\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to take weeks and cost millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.06,0:31:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 令尊同意这条路线 - 他错了 去做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your father approved this route. - Then my father was wrong. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.93,0:31:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大卫朵夫 - 我去跟她说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Davidov. - I'll talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.47,0:31:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在先父的葬礼上见过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you at my father's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.71,0:31:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.17,0:31:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,M夫人说要派人来 你是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}M told me she was sending someone. Mr…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.95,0:31:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.41,0:31:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.68,0:31:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识先父吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.62,0:31:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一面之缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met him once, briefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.72,0:31:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遗传了他的外交手腕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem to have inherited his touch for diplomacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.62,0:31:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说保住教堂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving the church?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.26,0:31:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也避免流血事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}And avoiding the bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.90,0:31:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百年前 先母的娘家 发现这儿的石油\N{\fnArial\fs30}100 years ago, my mother's family discovered the oil here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.77,0:31:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时苏联刚立国\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the Soviet Union was formed…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.37,0:31:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,共产党在接下来的70年内\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the Communists spent the next 70 years…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.77,0:31:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此大肆破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}…plundering our countryside for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.71,0:31:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在来的路上看到 他们造成的破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw their mess on the drive in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.48,0:32:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的输油管能让我们致富\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new pipeline will guarantee our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.48,0:32:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不能毁掉我们宝贵的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it would be a crime to destroy what little is left of our past.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.49,0:32:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是来此谈石油的 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't come here to talk about oil, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.83,0:32:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.03,0:32:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾失去过亲人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…have you ever lost a loved one, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.64,0:32:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,M夫人让我来因为 你有生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}M sent me because your life might be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.41,0:32:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我给你看样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.88,0:32:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条输油管长达八百英里 经过土耳其\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to build an 800-mile pipeline through Turkey…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.12,0:32:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有恐怖份子的伊拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}…past the terrorists in Iraq…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.92,0:32:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊朗和叙利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Iran and Syria.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.89,0:32:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up here…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.29,0:32:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏俄也有三条输油管\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the Russians have three competing pipelines…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.86,0:32:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会不择手段阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and they'll do anything to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.53,0:32:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,先父被杀 村民暴动\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was murdered, the villagers are rioting…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.57,0:33:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大老远来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you have come all this way…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.67,0:33:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就告诉我说我可能会有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to tell me that I "might" be in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.78,0:33:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怀疑有内贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We suspect there is an insider.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.55,0:33:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是先父的胸针\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father's pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.38,0:33:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是复制品\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, a duplicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.12,0:33:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,内藏的发送器 引爆炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a transmitter inside that set off the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.32,0:33:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,先父曾向情报局求助两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family has relied on Ml6 twice, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.96,0:33:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会犯同样的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't make that mistake a third time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.93,0:33:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,输油管一定会完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to finish building this pipeline…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.60,0:33:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你的帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.77,0:33:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪了 我得去检查测量管线\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll excuse me, I have to check the survey lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.94,0:33:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很想检查测量管线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always wanted to check the survey lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.28,0:33:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不肯轻易放弃 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't take no for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.35,0:33:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好会滑雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you know how to ski, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.92,0:33:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早知道你会冷若冰霜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came prepared for a cold reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.77,0:34:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,风太强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't land.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.81,0:34:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wind's too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.84,0:34:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold her steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.54,0:35:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你滑得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ski very well, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.61,0:35:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像很爱被人追\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems you enjoy being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.41,0:35:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概经常发生吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happens all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.95,0:35:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没你想的这么经常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less often than you might think.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.09,0:35:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两条输油管\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is where they meet…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.12,0:35:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是在这儿交接的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the two ends of the pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.16,0:35:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是令尊的遗志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father's legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.69,0:35:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family's legacy…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.03,0:35:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对世界的贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.44,0:35:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在等人吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Expecting visitors? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.65,0:36:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人来者不善\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a social call.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.18,0:36:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到谷底 我引他们到树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head for the gully. I'll lead them into the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.22,0:36:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.34,0:38:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,山脚下见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you back at the lodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.23,0:39:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 我们被活埋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's all right. - We're buried alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.23,0:39:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能留在这！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.90,0:39:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.37,0:39:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能呼吸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't breathe! I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.94,0:39:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 伊莉翠 看着我！看着我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. Elektra, look at me! Look at my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.21,0:39:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.75,0:39:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的眼睛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.95,0:39:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.45,0:39:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.62,0:39:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.54,0:40:23.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴库）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.32,0:40:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.38,0:40:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一些瘀青 并无大碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some bumps and bruises, but otherwise fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.82,0:40:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想见你 不是你 是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants to see you. Not you, Davidov. Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.40,0:40:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.44,0:40:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得问你一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.47,0:40:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want you to tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.94,0:40:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.41,0:40:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是谁想杀我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's trying to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.15,0:41:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.82,0:41:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我会找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm gonna find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.15,0:41:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不够好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.32,0:41:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑案后我很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the kidnapping, I was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.43,0:41:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢出门 不敢独处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid to go outside. I was afraid to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.53,0:41:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢靠近人群\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid to be in a crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.93,0:41:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不敢做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid to do anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.20,0:41:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我惊觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I realized…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.50,0:41:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能躲在阴影下\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I can't hide in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.77,0:41:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能一辈子都害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let fear run my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.84,0:41:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.98,0:41:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到他以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I find him…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.05,0:41:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不需要再害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you won't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.45,0:41:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.85,0:41:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来陪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.49,0:41:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.33,0:41:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.80,0:41:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你的职责是要 保护我的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was your job to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.67,0:41:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.40,0:41:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.41,0:42:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快就会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.12,0:42:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在到底谁在害怕 邦德先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who's afraid now, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.56,0:43:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见魏伦汀苏考斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see Valentin Zukovsky.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.19,0:43:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.83,0:43:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏特加马丁尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vodka martini.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.73,0:43:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,用摇的 别用搅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shaken, not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.37,0:43:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说詹姆斯邦德找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him James Bond is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.81,0:43:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.71,0:43:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你是没听清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.36,0:43:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏先生很乐意见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Zukovsky would be delighted to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.00,0:44:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先请\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.93,0:44:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你先请\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.10,0:44:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}I insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.31,0:44:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也来一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a little for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.18,0:44:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德！詹姆斯邦德！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond! James Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.68,0:44:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是妮娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet Nina.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.48,0:44:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,和薇洛丝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Verushka.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.29,0:44:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫她们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose the girls, Valentin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.32,0:44:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.02,0:44:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么突然觉得 我买的保险还不够？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I suddenly worried that I'm not carrying enough insurance?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.59,0:44:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 老詹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chill out, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.47,0:44:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.60,0:44:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快滚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. Beat it. Scram.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.10,0:44:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛮牛 把钱给她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bull, give them an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.18,0:44:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要确定她们在我赌场都输光\N{\fnArial\fs30}And make sure they lose it in this casino.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.25,0:44:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,后会有期 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you later, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.35,0:44:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的钱都存在你的嘴巴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you put your money where your mouth is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.42,0:45:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛮牛信不过银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bullion does not trust banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.89,0:45:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想聊什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what would you like to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.26,0:45:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕帮不上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure I can really help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.50,0:45:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在都做合法生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a legitimate businessman now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.27,0:45:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点我的苏氏极品鱼子酱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you care for some caviar? My own brand: Zukovsky's Finest.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.34,0:45:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.48,0:45:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏俄特种部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russian Special Services.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.78,0:45:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,原子能源部的反恐怖份子单位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atomic Energy Antiterrorist Unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.42,0:45:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿找到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you find this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.12,0:45:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从一个今早想刺杀 伊莉翠金恩的人的身上拿到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took it off a Parahawk which tried to kill Elektra King this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.85,0:45:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,幕后主使是雷纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renard is behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.83,0:45:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们最好先喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you and I had better have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.47,0:45:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿富汗事件后 KGB认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then after Afghanistan, the KGB decided…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.24,0:45:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷纳太危险 于是把他开除\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Renard was a liability and just cut him loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.61,0:45:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在独立作业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he works freelance.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.58,0:45:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他替谁工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.21,0:46:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,四条输油管互相竞争\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are four competing pipelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.35,0:46:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌这里有一半的赌客\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm willing to bet half the customers in this casino would be…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.82,0:46:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,都想金恩输油管消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}…very happy to see the King pipeline disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.39,0:46:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么好笑？- 没什么 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's funny? - Nothing. It appears…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.76,0:46:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,金小姐很大胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Miss King does not share your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.24,0:46:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.21,0:46:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same thing you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.14,0:46:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出想杀我的歹徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for the people who tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.74,0:46:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我现在就带你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take you home. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.08,0:46:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要证明我不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I want them to see I'm not frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.22,0:46:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,金小姐 很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss King, how very nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.42,0:46:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我免费为你保留了令尊的位子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've kept your father's chair free.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.52,0:46:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,免费？拜托 这里什么都要钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free? Nothing comes free from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.49,0:46:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,令尊有一百万美元的信用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father had a credit line with us. One million U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.33,0:46:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样有这个特权\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be happy to extend you that courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.00,0:46:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想玩点什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's it to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.44,0:46:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,21点 令尊的最爱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blackjack, your father's favorite?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.34,0:47:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们干脆一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's keep it simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.94,0:47:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一翻两瞪眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}One card.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.48,0:47:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌大一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}High draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.28,0:47:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百万元\N{\fnArial\fs30}A million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.56,0:47:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.39,0:47:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,前三张抽掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bury the top three cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.66,0:47:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下定决心想保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're determined to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.00,0:47:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太任性了 别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}From yourself. You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.84,0:47:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不能随心所欲 活着也没有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no point in living if you can't feel alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.65,0:47:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,红心皇后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen of hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.83,0:47:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你碰上了克星\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears you've been beaten…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.07,0:48:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑桃A\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by the ace of clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.01,0:48:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别难过 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hard feelings, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.71,0:48:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.15,0:48:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.36,0:48:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我玩不起这种游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a game I can't afford to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.06,0:48:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.47,0:48:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大卫朵夫呢？- 我放他一晚的假\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to Davidov? - I gave him the night off.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.92,0:48:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临魔鬼窟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Devil's Breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.73,0:49:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,数千年来印度朝圣者 前来此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}For thousands of years, Hindu pilgrims journeyed to this holy place…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.00,0:49:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,见识永不熄灭的神迹之火\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to witness the wonder of the natural flames that never die…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.84,0:49:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为了证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and to test their devotion…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.94,0:49:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对神的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to God…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.48,0:49:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边握住滚烫的石块\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by holding the scalding rocks in their hands…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.48,0:49:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边向神祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as they said their prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.29,0:49:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫朵夫 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Davidov…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.32,0:49:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午出了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what happened this afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.26,0:49:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保证过给我最顶尖的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised me your best men.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.29,0:49:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾考夫提供最新的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Arkov supplied the latest weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.56,0:49:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 可是邦德…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but Bond…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.26,0:49:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德手无寸铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond was unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.97,0:49:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 艾考夫？都准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, Arkov? Is everything ready for tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.74,0:49:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,授权书和通行证在车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the authorization and passes in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.51,0:49:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机今晚就到 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have arranged for a plane tonight, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.58,0:49:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.85,0:49:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该取消其它的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should scrub the rest of the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.88,0:49:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击直升机应该回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Parahawks were meant to be returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.12,0:49:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人会对我起疑心\N{\fnArial\fs30}People will ask questions, even of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.45,0:50:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为他的无能\N{\fnArial\fs30}All because of his incompetence.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.02,0:50:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.12,0:50:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 应该惩罚他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you're right. He should be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.99,0:50:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫朵夫 拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Davidov, hold this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.97,0:50:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太高估你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was wrong of me to expect so much of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.61,0:50:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.01,0:50:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不够忠心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He failed his test of devotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.78,0:50:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以坐他的位子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.78,0:50:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以取代他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take his I.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.19,0:50:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一定要准时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do be on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.74,0:50:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的肩膀受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.54,0:50:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定很痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.78,0:51:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,得多照顾点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It needs constant attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.85,0:51:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.59,0:51:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew when I first saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.69,0:51:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道事情会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it would be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.41,0:51:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些冰块够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough ice for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.33,0:51:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么活下来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.67,0:51:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我色诱守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seduced the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.71,0:51:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.98,0:52:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他制伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gave me control.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.68,0:52:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后拿了枪就扫射\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the rest, I got a gun and started shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.42,0:52:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.05,0:52:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么活下来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you do to survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.23,0:52:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在美女身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take pleasure…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.86,0:52:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in great beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.59,0:55:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 时候不早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. It's getting late.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.13,0:55:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫朵夫呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Davidov?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.03,0:55:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是要来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told to expect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.07,0:55:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被埋在工作堆中\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was buried with work.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.44,0:55:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 把你的东西带着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Get your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.29,0:55:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.82,0:55:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.49,0:55:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.83,0:55:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,带来了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bring it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.76,0:55:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,礼物呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The grease.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.23,0:55:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.91,0:55:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.63,0:56:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好 十分钟后开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready. We're 10 minutes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.23,0:56:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得戴上通行证\N{\fnArial\fs30}But make sure you wear the I.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.75,0:56:38.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中亚 哈萨克）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.51,0:57:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出去透透气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go get some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.03,0:57:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 艾考夫博士 我很景仰您的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Kazakhstan, Dr. Arkov. I'm a great admirer of your research.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.40,0:57:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿很少见到您这种大人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not often we see someone of your stature here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.54,0:57:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go where the work takes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.31,0:57:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的运输证明呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, you have the transport documents?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.09,0:57:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从核弹里取出钸元素\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled the plutonium out of the one inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.72,0:57:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以引爆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can detonate the triggers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.70,0:57:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是拆除核弹专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, our IDA physicist.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.67,0:57:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,省点力气 她对男人没兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bother. Not interested in men.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.27,0:58:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.14,0:58:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年出四次任务 她都没闹绯闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This year we decommissioned four test sites. Not even a glimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.51,0:58:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿有事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here for a reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.18,0:58:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是想闹绯闻？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are you just hoping for a glimmer?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.02,0:58:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.28,0:58:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,米盖艾考夫 苏俄原子能源部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikhail Arkov. Russian Atomic Energy Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.12,0:58:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.66,0:58:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.06,0:58:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉莫丝琼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Jones. Christmas Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.99,0:58:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿我的名字开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't make any jokes. I've heard them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.30,0:58:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道任何 关于博士的玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know any doctor jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.77,0:58:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 搭电梯下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is okay. Take the elevator down the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.27,0:58:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友已经在下面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends are already down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.77,0:58:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必穿防护衣吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't I get some protection?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.24,0:58:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必 艾考夫博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dr. Arkov.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.11,0:58:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面的钸元素很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down there it's weapons-grade plutonium. Reasonably safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.41,0:58:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有你们的俄制氢弹 漏出的氢元素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up here we have leaking hydrogen bombs that your lab built…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.35,0:58:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这半年来我一直都在处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which I've spent the last six months cleaning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.22,0:58:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怕的应该是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you need any protection at all, it's from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.72,0:58:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的同事在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends are waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.43,0:59:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.97,0:59:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you forgetting?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.14,0:59:12.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（离开时请归还辐射标签）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.27,0:59:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.31,0:59:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.91,0:59:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,以苏俄人来说 你的英文说得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.08,0:59:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读过牛津大学
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.35,1:00:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在等大卫朵夫吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expecting Davidov?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.35,1:00:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他吃了子弹 来不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}He caught a bullet instead of the plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.45,1:00:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.55,1:00:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.09,1:00:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就死了 你杀不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill me. I'm already dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.66,1:00:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你还没死透\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not dead enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.99,1:00:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该感谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show a little gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.93,1:00:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在银行家的办公室救了你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did spare your life at the banker's office.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.07,1:00:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.83,1:00:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你死 你那时候在替我工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't kill you. You were working for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.10,1:01:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把钱带回去 炸死金恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You delivered the money, killed King.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.37,1:01:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你又把飞机带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you brought me the plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.78,1:01:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷走核弹有什么计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your plan for the bomb?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.11,1:01:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先说 还是你根本就没计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You first. Or could it be you don't have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.85,1:01:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,核弹得留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bomb will never leave this room.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.08,1:01:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither will you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.13,1:01:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,被一个搞不清楚状况的人威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}How sad to be threatened by a man…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.79,1:01:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who can't grasp what he's involved in.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.33,1:01:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不信的人只会报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge is not hard to fathom for a man who believes in nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.57,1:01:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you believe in?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.30,1:01:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,贪婪的资本主义？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preservation of capital?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.97,1:01:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管开枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.14,1:01:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I welcome it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.74,1:01:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手下听见之后会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men will hear the shot and kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.41,1:01:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后军队会赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the firefight will bring down half the army from above.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.71,1:01:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在二十分钟内没打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when a certain phone call isn't made in 20 minutes…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.05,1:01:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉翠就没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Elektra dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.09,1:01:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在唬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.32,1:01:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很美 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's beautiful, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.63,1:01:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你不是她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have had her before…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.09,1:01:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when she was innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.23,1:02:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替你开了她的苞\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does it feel…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.10,1:02:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,的感觉怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to know I broke her in for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.24,1:02:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我通常不杀手无寸铁的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I usually hate killing an unarmed man.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.94,1:02:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷血杀手不好当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold-blooded murder is a filthy business.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.91,1:02:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也厌倦了被处决\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man tires of being executed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.31,1:02:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我对你没感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in your case, I feel nothing…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.91,1:02:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.15,1:02:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不能随心所欲 活着也没有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then again, there's no point living if you can't feel alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.22,1:02:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把枪放下！- 上校 走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drop the gun! - Keep away, colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.63,1:02:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是冒牌货 艾考夫博士已经63岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an impostor. Dr. Arkov is 63 years old.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.60,1:02:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和飞机上的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your impostor.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.26,1:02:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,才是冒牌货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with the men outside on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.77,1:02:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要偷走核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll steal the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.00,1:02:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你把枪放下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said drop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.48,1:02:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your knees!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.72,1:02:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.09,1:03:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会杀死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would've killed us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.39,1:03:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他讲过话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you speak to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.83,1:03:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他不是核能科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but he's no atomic scientist.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.86,1:03:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是你允许他下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you were the one who allowed him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.78,1:03:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逮到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had me…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.51,1:03:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我早知道你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I knew you couldn't…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.25,1:03:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,肩负不了重任\N{\fnArial\fs30}…shoulder the responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.82,1:03:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without any interruptions, let's proceed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.13,1:03:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,生面孔太多 包括你的在内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many new faces are here, including yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.53,1:03:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我满意之前 核弹就留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bomb doesn't move until I am satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.47,1:03:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都给我上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you, to the surface, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.06,1:04:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.00,1:04:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.04,1:04:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被封住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're sealing us in.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.91,1:04:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.18,1:04:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替英国政府工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work for the British government.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.92,1:04:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.77,1:06:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别生气 邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hard feelings, Mr. Bond…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.28,1:06:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们扯平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but we're even.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.81,1:06:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.55,1:06:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会没有感觉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you'll feel nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.44,1:07:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门封住！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal the door! Close it!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.52,1:07:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.68,1:07:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续跑 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going! Move! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.65,1:07:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这英国的间谍叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a British spy. Do you have a name?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.92,1:07:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name's Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.52,1:08:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.17,1:08:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停下来！快跳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop! Go, go! Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.39,1:08:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跑不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't get very far.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.13,1:08:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,核子弹头都有定位晶片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every warhead has a locator card.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.00,1:08:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以追踪讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can track the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.27,1:08:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean one of these?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.61,1:08:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷纳的飞机在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have the range of Renard's plane?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.91,1:08:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能在苏俄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anywhere in this circle: Russia…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.91,1:08:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚美尼亚 伊朗 哈萨克…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Armenia, Iran, Kazakhstan, Uzbekistan…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.45,1:09:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打搅了 伊莉翠从巴库打来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to interrupt. Elektra is calling from Baku.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.15,1:09:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她用影像电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on the video line.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.62,1:09:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,放到大荧幕上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put her on the wall screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.89,1:09:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不想烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I would never call you except…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.23,1:09:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过詹姆斯失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…James has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.33,1:09:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在半夜离开我的别墅\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left my villa in the middle of the night…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.77,1:09:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的安全主任\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and my head of security has been found…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.27,1:09:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在机场附近遇害\N{\fnArial\fs30}…near a local airstrip, murdered.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.01,1:09:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我派人过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll send someone out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.41,1:09:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,M夫人 你能来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}M, could you come?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.75,1:09:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help thinking…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.32,1:09:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm next.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.99,1:09:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上送我过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.32,1:09:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快送我过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get me out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.98,1:10:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾柏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabor?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.86,1:10:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很惊訝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.53,1:10:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you? Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.90,1:10:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.63,1:10:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我该问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should ask you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.63,1:10:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.27,1:10:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不能随心所欲 活着也没有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}…"There's no point in living if you can't feel alive."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.94,1:10:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的座右铭吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that right, Elektra? Isn't that your motto?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.01,1:10:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在讲什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.04,1:10:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你老友雷纳教你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or did you steal it from your old friend Renard?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.64,1:10:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他聊了一下 他连我的肩伤在哪都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He and I had a chat. Knew all about us. Knew about my shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.42,1:10:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道怎么弄痛我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knew exactly where to hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.18,1:10:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说雷纳想杀我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renard's the man who's trying to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.65,1:10:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,少装了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the act.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.39,1:10:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再演戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.99,1:10:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.49,1:10:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.20,1:10:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫做“斯德哥尔摩症候群”\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called Stockholm syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.50,1:10:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑架受害人的通病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Common in kidnappings.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.87,1:11:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害人通常年轻天真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young, impressionable victim.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.57,1:11:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,平日受到百般呵护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheltered.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.27,1:11:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有性经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sexually inexperienced.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.31,1:11:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,手段高明的绑匪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A powerful kidnapper skilled in torture, manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.65,1:11:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害人突然念头一闪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something snaps in the victim's mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.62,1:11:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害人爱上绑匪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The captive falls in love with her captor.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.12,1:11:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.19,1:11:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.52,1:11:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个禽兽都不如的东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That animal. That monster?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.86,1:11:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他令我作呕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He disgusts me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.70,1:11:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disgust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.30,1:11:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道你的肩伤 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he knew where to hurt you, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.47,1:11:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在丧礼上带着吊腕带\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a sling on your arm at the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.47,1:11:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要跟你上床也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't have to sleep with you to find that out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.38,1:11:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used your exact words.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.91,1:11:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.85,1:11:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道他一直想杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew all the time he was out there, coming for me…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.08,1:11:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却欺骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you lied.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.12,1:11:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你利用我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.19,1:11:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你利用我当诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used me as bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.59,1:11:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还和我做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you made love to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.23,1:11:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.06,1:12:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在等他下次行动之前 打发时间吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To pass the time as you waited for him to strike?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.81,1:12:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在输油管附近杀了十个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's struck again. Ten men are dead at the pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.42,1:12:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.82,1:12:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便 我已打给M夫人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do what you want to do, but I've called M.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.86,1:12:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会来指挥大局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's coming to take charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.62,1:13:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前情况如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want an update. Where do we stand?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.96,1:13:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷纳的手下 把定位晶片抽掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of Renard's men took the locator card from the bomb…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.29,1:13:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法追踪 可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so we can't track it. But…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.93,1:13:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.83,1:13:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.10,1:13:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I don't think you should be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.07,1:13:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能提醒你我是因为你才来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I remind you that you're the reason I'm here, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.74,1:13:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你违反命令 把她丢下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disobeyed an order and left that girl alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.38,1:13:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她没有你想像的那么无辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps that girl isn't as innocent as you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.48,1:13:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 假如偷换\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you saying? - Suppose the inside man…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.35,1:13:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,金恩胸针的内贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the one who switched King's lapel pin…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.22,1:13:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个女内贼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…turned out to be an inside woman?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.89,1:13:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她杀死父亲 破坏自家的油管？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She kills her father and attacks her own pipeline?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.03,1:13:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？图的是什么？- 我还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? To what end? - I don't know…yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.30,1:13:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.70,1:13:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不太对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.17,1:13:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.21,1:13:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,侦查车\N{\fnArial\fs30}An observation rig.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.01,1:13:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在输油管内寻找裂缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travels in the pipe looking for cracks.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.28,1:13:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.28,1:14:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.38,1:14:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't respond.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.49,1:14:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方没有炸弹 没有核弹的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place is clean. No sign of…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.52,1:14:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 核弹在输油管里 - 我的天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The bomb is in the pipeline. - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.22,1:14:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们带核弹经过这里 这解释了之前的攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}They brought it through here. That'd explain the attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.23,1:14:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹被送往主控室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heading for the oil terminal.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.86,1:14:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成最大的破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where it would do the most damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.93,1:14:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你的员工立刻疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have your men evacuate that terminal.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.83,1:14:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信我了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now do you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.97,1:14:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是紧急状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an emergency situation. So please…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.81,1:14:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请立刻疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}…clear the room. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.84,1:14:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要破坏输油管\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going for the oil.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.08,1:14:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是西方未来唯一的输油管\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one pipeline the West is counting on to supply our reserves.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.28,1:14:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有办法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have an idea?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.75,1:14:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.92,1:14:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹有多远？速度有多快？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far is the rig from the terminal? How fast is it traveling?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.49,1:14:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在106英里外 时速70英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 106 miles from the terminal, going 70 miles an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.16,1:14:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有78分钟 还有侦查车吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have 78 minutes. Is there another rig?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.33,1:14:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在炸弹前面有一辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one parked in the passageway ahead of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.30,1:14:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能带我去吗？- 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Charles, can you get me out there? - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.20,1:14:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 你要去做的 是我想你要去做的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Are you gonna do what I think you're gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.11,1:15:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拆除核弹需要什么？- 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do I need to defuse a bomb? - Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.06,1:15:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.53,1:15:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,闸门在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hatch to the passageway.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.80,1:15:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来操控 试着让炸弹赶上我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep the speed up so the other rig catches up with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.17,1:15:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会等你的消息 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll wait to hear from you. - Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.10,1:15:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会开这玩意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how to drive this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.94,1:15:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,开这玩意不需要博士学位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't exactly take a degree in nuclear physics.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.45,1:15:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们进了输油管\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in the pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.59,1:15:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on the move.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.34,1:16:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快一点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.38,1:16:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有丝毫的机会 邦德就会成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's the slightest chance, Bond will succeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.68,1:16:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是最顶尖的情报员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the best we have…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.79,1:16:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我都没告诉过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…though I'd never tell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.76,1:16:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.03,1:16:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.47,1:16:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶上来了 快一点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's closing up. Faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.27,1:16:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.19,1:16:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,停不下来！刹车卡住了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No brakes! The controls are jammed!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.64,1:17:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是战略性弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a tactical fission device.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.81,1:17:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,威力不大 稳住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Low yield. Hold me steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.61,1:17:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拆过几百个 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've defused hundreds of these, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.78,1:17:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但不在这种情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but they're usually standing still.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.55,1:17:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命充满了挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life's full of small challenges.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.19,1:17:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.52,1:17:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,螺丝头不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone stripped the screw heads.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.89,1:17:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人动过这枚核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's tampered with the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.08,1:17:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一半的钸元素不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, half the plutonium's missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.55,1:17:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是什么？它不能引起核爆吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you saying? It couldn't go nuclear?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.39,1:18:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果被引爆还是能炸死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still enough explosive to kill us both if the trigger goes off.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.59,1:18:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让它爆炸 - 我可以拆除\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let it blow. - But I can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.49,1:18:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它爆炸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it blow!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.83,1:18:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 别管它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me. Leave it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.07,1:18:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去 过去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move down. Move down!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.11,1:18:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跳！跳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump! Go on, jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.51,1:18:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.16,1:18:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗宾森报告说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robinson's reporting.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.33,1:18:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bomb was a dud.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.33,1:18:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过引爆还是能毁坏 一段50英尺长的油管\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the triggering charge blew out a 50-yard section of the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.94,1:18:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.11,1:18:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.94,1:18:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.38,1:18:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我有礼物要送你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.92,1:19:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,先父的遗物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that belonged to my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.65,1:19:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会希望你收下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would've wanted you to have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.52,1:19:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps this isn't the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.82,1:19:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.29,1:19:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他经常提到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He often spoke of how compassionately…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.80,1:19:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被绑架时 你给他最真诚的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you advised him on the best course of action during my kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.70,1:19:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是非常宝贵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very valuable, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.21,1:19:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想把胸针也炸掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't let it explode with the rest of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.11,1:19:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可惜那笔钱 没把你也给炸死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was very upset when the money didn't kill both of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.05,1:19:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为没有机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think I'd get another chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.26,1:19:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来你却自己把机会送上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you dropped the answer right in my lap.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.09,1:19:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.59,1:19:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也说他是最顶尖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as you say, he's the best you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.63,1:19:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是过去式了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or should I say, "had"?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.04,1:19:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带上直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her to the helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.45,1:20:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.98,1:20:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳 跳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump, jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.65,1:20:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna explain why you did that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.82,1:20:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能拆除的 你差点害死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've stopped it. You almost killed us.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.56,1:20:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.59,1:20:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以为我们死了 她的诡计就得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks we're dead, and she thinks she got away with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.06,1:20:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是间谍 请你白话一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna put that in English for those of us who don't speak "spy"?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.70,1:20:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's "she"?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.00,1:20:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉翠金恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elektra King.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.37,1:20:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她干嘛要炸掉自己的输油管？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would she blow up her own pipeline?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.70,1:20:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了证明她的无辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes her look innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.04,1:20:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸掩饰钸元素遭窃的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}The explosion covers up the theft of the plutonium.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.54,1:20:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,使人误为恐怖份子攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like a terrorist attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.41,1:20:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为什么留下这一半钸元素？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why leave this half?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.02,1:20:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下这些钸元素 才能掩饰他们偷走的另一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's enough to spread around to cover up what they did take.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.85,1:20:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拿另一半干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will they do with the other half?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.12,1:20:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这分量做不出核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not enough to make a nuclear bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.76,1:20:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是专家 你解释给我听 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're the scientist, you tell me. - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.63,1:20:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天下最凶狠的恐怖份子 偷走六公斤的钸元素\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the world's greatest terrorist running around with 6 kilos…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.17,1:20:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会干好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of plutonium can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.00,1:21:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不拿回来 就会被打屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get it back, or somebody will have my ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.24,1:21:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个以后再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}First things first.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.88,1:21:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫罗宾逊 收到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond to Robinson. Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.01,1:21:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 跟你合作之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, before we go any further…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.21,1:21:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想先知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I just wanna know…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.62,1:21:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟伊莉翠有什么关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the story with you and Elektra?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.25,1:21:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有敌对关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're strictly platonic. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.12,1:21:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗宾逊 收到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond to Robinson. Copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.69,1:21:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your story?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.66,1:21:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会跑到哈萨克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here in Kazakhstan?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.00,1:21:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样 逃避这些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avoiding those kind of questions, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.64,1:21:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收到了 紧急状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read you, 007. Red alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.40,1:21:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,M夫人跟伊莉翠一起失踪了 还有三人挂彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}M is missing with Elektra. Three men down.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.67,1:21:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Await instructions. Out.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.24,1:21:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.75,1:21:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘了一件很关键的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have overlooked one critical element.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.42,1:21:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？更多钸元素吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? More plutonium?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.25,1:21:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beluga.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.09,1:21:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄制鱼子酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caviar.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.76,1:22:00.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（土耳其 伊斯坦堡）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.12,1:22:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带什么给我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brought me something?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.50,1:22:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变世界的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power to reshape the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.23,1:22:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.97,1:22:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.54,1:22:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉一下你的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touch your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.82,1:23:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也带了礼物给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have brought something for you as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.83,1:23:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your present.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.80,1:23:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是死去的邦德的心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Courtesy of the late Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.10,1:23:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,下令处死我的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}My executioner.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.74,1:23:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜没把你杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overpraise, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.14,1:23:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的手下会解决你的 - 你的手下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But my people will finish the job. - Your people?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.61,1:23:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会让你在此自生自灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people will leave you here to rot…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.31,1:23:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你对我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…just like you left me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.95,1:23:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.45,1:23:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你父亲… - 他什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your father… - My father was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.15,1:23:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他偷走我母亲的石油王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}His kingdom he stole from my mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.76,1:23:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要夺回我的王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kingdom I will rightly take back.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.43,1:23:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把她变成这样很得意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're proud of what you did to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.17,1:23:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的功劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid it is you who deserve credit.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.31,1:23:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时的她\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I took her…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.24,1:23:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是天真无邪\N{\fnArial\fs30}…she was promise itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.91,1:24:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却把她推入我这个火坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left her at the mercy of a man like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.68,1:24:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毁了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ruined her.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.05,1:24:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.35,1:24:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为了逮到我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.29,1:24:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她比我好太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's worth 50 of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.13,1:24:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点我很同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once, I agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.96,1:24:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们的命运相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we also share a common fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.27,1:24:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will die…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.80,1:24:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这城市的人一起丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…along with everyone in this city…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.41,1:24:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,西方国家的未来 也会毁于一旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the bright, starry, oil-driven future of the West.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.98,1:24:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你派人刺杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you sent your man to kill me…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.52,1:24:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就一直看着时钟 分分秒秒在走\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I've been watching time tick slowly away…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.12,1:24:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,走向我的灭亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}…marching toward my own death.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.86,1:24:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you can have the same pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.10,1:24:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你看着时钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch these hands, M.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.90,1:24:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天正午\N{\fnArial\fs30}By noon tomorrow…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.31,1:24:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你的死期\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your time is up.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.31,1:25:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I guarantee you…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.41,1:25:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I will not miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.70,1:25:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好美\N{\fnArial\fs30}So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.84,1:25:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好光滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}So smooth.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.64,1:25:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好温暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}So warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.01,1:25:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.85,1:25:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.65,1:25:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为邦德死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Bond is dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.79,1:25:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是要他死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.53,1:25:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it's what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.60,1:25:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.04,1:26:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是好情人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a good lover?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.21,1:26:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.84,1:26:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我没感觉吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't feel anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.46,1:26:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点都没有感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.01,1:26:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.42,1:26:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But surely…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.96,1:26:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,会感觉到这吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you can feel this?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.90,1:27:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.07,1:27:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些欢愉吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.72,1:27:31.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（里海）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.92,1:27:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.02,1:28:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是多事之秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always something.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.49,1:28:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是赌场\N{\fnArial\fs30}First the casino.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.89,1:28:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是鱼子酱工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the caviar factory.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.89,1:28:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是自由市场经济的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a slave to the free-market economy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.08,1:28:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond is alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.85,1:28:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方真是一团乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is nothing in this place straight?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.16,1:28:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.06,1:28:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么进来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how did you get in?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.06,1:28:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要通知警卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call security…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.10,1:28:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好地谢谢他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and congratulate them.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.60,1:28:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来一杯吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.87,1:28:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能像别人一样 打招呼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you say hello like a normal person?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.14,1:28:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.25,1:28:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是啦 走后门\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Down the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.18,1:29:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟伊莉翠有什么来往？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your business with Elektra?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.75,1:29:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你跟她才来电\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were the one giving her the business.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.46,1:29:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她输给你一百万 好像理所当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}She drops $1 million in your casino, and you don't even blink.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.06,1:29:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么付钱给你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she paying you off for?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.96,1:29:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我劝你 跟这种男人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if I were you, a relationship with a man like that…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.07,1:29:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有好下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I wouldn't bet on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.34,1:29:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,五千元的鱼子酱泡汤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}$5000 of beluga. Ruined.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.04,1:29:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟核弹比起来 这算不了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nothing compared to what a nuclear bomb can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.88,1:29:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一枚核弹遭窃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a nuclear bomb stolen this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.28,1:29:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷纳跟伊莉翠是一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renard and Elektra King are working together.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.82,1:29:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 你到底知道什么？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't know. - Well, what do you know?!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.70,1:32:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q先生会被气炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q's not gonna like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.46,1:33:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.43,1:34:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.46,1:34:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.33,1:34:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们讲到哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where were we?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.47,1:34:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丢条绳子吧！- 不行 先说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A rope, please! - No. The truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.70,1:34:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把M夫人抓走\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has M.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.87,1:34:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知情 - 她想杀你灭口\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know nothing. - Those blades were meant for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.24,1:34:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does Elektra King want you dead for?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.88,1:35:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你毁了我的工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you who destroyed my factory.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.44,1:35:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把我的劳斯莱斯沉入湖底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you drown my Rolls-Royce…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.58,1:35:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在还想用鱼子酱把我淹死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and now you're trying to drown me in my own caviar!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.28,1:35:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我上去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.12,1:35:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜这儿没有香槟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad we don't have any champagne.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.49,1:35:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是酸奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or sour cream.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.66,1:35:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Occasionally…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.63,1:35:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会替她弄到俄制的器材\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I get equipment for her. Machinery. Russian stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.80,1:35:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌场的一百万呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the payoff in the casino?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.03,1:35:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是特别差事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a special job.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.07,1:35:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我侄子是海军\N{\fnArial\fs30}My nephew is in the navy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.14,1:35:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他替她走私一些机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's smuggling some machinery for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.54,1:35:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪儿？- 我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.58,1:35:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.98,1:35:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪儿？- 伊斯坦堡！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Istanbul!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.79,1:35:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.83,1:35:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这金牙猴王 跑哪儿去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been, you gold-encrusted buffoon?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.40,1:35:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我被撞昏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, boss. I must have bumped my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.33,1:36:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我救出来 我会让你知道什么是撞昏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here, I'll show you what a bumped head feels like.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.61,1:36:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.91,1:36:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋顶没了至少墙壁还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no roof, but at least we have four good walls.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.32,1:36:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险公司一定会抓狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The insurance company is never going to believe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.65,1:37:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里以前是KGB的分部\N{\fnArial\fs30}This used to be the KGB's Istanbul safe house. Now it's FSB.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.09,1:37:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是联邦安全局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Federal Security Bureau.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.06,1:37:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是换汤不换药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same old friendly service with a new name.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.30,1:37:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到尼可莱吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you raise Nikoli? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.40,1:37:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着扫描紧急讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try scanning the emergency frequencies.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.67,1:37:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.24,1:37:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前至少有一百个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the old days, there were 100 places…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.84,1:37:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让潜艇偷偷升到水面\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where a submarine could surface undetected.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.48,1:37:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜艇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Submarine?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.28,1:37:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你侄子的潜艇是什么型号？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What class is your nephew running?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.15,1:37:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们称之为维特3型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor 3, you call it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.52,1:37:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,核能潜艇 他们要用潜艇的核子反应炉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuclear. He's not loading cargo. They want the sub to use the reactor.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.19,1:38:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.22,1:38:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钸元素放进核子反应炉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put weapons-grade plutonium in that sub's reactor…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.36,1:38:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会造成严重的核爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}…instant, catastrophic meltdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.93,1:38:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像是场意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making it all look just like an accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.93,1:38:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.63,1:38:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,里海的输油管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the existing pipelines from the Caspian Sea…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.30,1:38:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把石油运到北部\N{\fnArial\fs30}…go to the north. Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.04,1:38:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 再用油轮从黑海 运到伊斯坦堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The oil is put on the tankers, shipped across the Black Sea to Istanbul.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.74,1:38:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,核爆会摧毁伊斯坦堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The explosion would destroy Istanbul…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.78,1:38:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,污染整个博斯普鲁斯海峡几十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}…contaminating the Bosporus for decades.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.15,1:38:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样一来 只有一个方法能输出石油\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'd be one way to get the oil out.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.49,1:38:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,从南边到地中海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down south to the Med.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.09,1:38:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,金恩输油管\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.02,1:38:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉翠的输油管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elektra's pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.32,1:38:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要找到尼克莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must find Nikoli.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.93,1:38:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克莱舰长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Nikoli?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.43,1:38:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.47,1:38:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备装货了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to load your cargo.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.24,1:38:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们只有几个小时 - 你用最少的人员？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have only a few hours. - You came with skeleton crew?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.61,1:38:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们付不起太多人 - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's all we can afford. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.04,1:38:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,给弟兄们的白兰地和点心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some brandy and refreshments for your men.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.35,1:38:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.72,1:39:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.49,1:39:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the time?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.44,1:39:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的死期到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for you to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.94,1:40:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收到讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got something.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.31,1:40:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在紧急频道上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the emergency frequency.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.28,1:40:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,每十五秒发出两组六位数号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two six-digit numbers cycled every 15 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.08,1:40:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,GPS定位讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}A GPS signal. Position coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.15,1:40:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,核弹晶片 M夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locator card. M.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.42,1:40:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这儿 - 处女塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - Maiden's Tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.39,1:40:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been there?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.09,1:40:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 蛮牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Mr. Bullion.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.26,1:40:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有炸弹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bomb!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.27,1:40:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.52,1:40:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先请\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.56,1:40:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}I insist.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.94,1:41:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的晚餐好吃吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoyed your meal, boys?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.72,1:41:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们丢进海里喂鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them up and throw them in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.13,1:41:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,反应炉在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The extruder's in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.17,1:41:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得花半小时做成钸元素棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take half an hour to set up the machine to make the plutonium rod.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.98,1:41:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们带进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put them in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.96,1:41:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,反应炉没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reactor is secured.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.93,1:41:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都照计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is complete as planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.33,1:42:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 直升机来了吗？- 半小时后会来接我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is your helicopter ready? - It'll pick me up in half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.60,1:42:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是结局了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then this is the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.17,1:42:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.81,1:42:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界将全面改观\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world will never be the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.19,1:42:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来在你手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future is yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.53,1:42:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好地玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.81,1:42:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你不来搅局\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd kept away…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.25,1:42:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许哪天我们真的能相爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we might've met in a few years and become lovers once more.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.23,1:43:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她押去雷纳那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her to Renard.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.53,1:43:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她好漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.93,1:43:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也上过她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had her too?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.21,1:43:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能让你称霸天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've given you the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.54,1:43:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不贪得无厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.05,1:43:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foolish sentiment.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.12,1:43:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我家族的座右铭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family motto.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.42,1:43:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,考古学家在这里 挖出很多古董花瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were digging near here, and they found some very pretty vases.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.06,1:43:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还找到这张椅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They also found this chair.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.90,1:43:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现代人都不会念旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we ignore the old ways at our peril…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.04,1:43:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.84,1:43:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,M夫人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's M?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.58,1:43:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就快粉身碎骨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon she'll be everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.08,1:44:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.75,1:44:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你爱上雷纳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because you fell for Renard?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.99,1:44:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,再转五下你的脖子 就会被绞断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five more turns and your neck will break.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.63,1:44:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向都很会玩弄男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always had a power over men.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.13,1:44:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我知道我父亲不付赎金\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I realized my father wouldn't rescue me from the kidnappers…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.87,1:44:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就得跟绑匪结盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I knew I had to form another alliance.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.01,1:44:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.11,1:44:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把雷纳玩弄于股掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}…turned Renard.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.11,1:44:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也玩弄了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.95,1:44:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你更容易玩弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}…only you were even easier.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.42,1:44:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫他真的动手伤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him he had to hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.86,1:44:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来一定要像真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had to make it look real.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.79,1:44:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he refused…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.16,1:44:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说我自己来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I told him I would do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.97,1:44:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀死了你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you killed your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.81,1:45:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他先杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.88,1:45:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不肯付赎金就是杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed me the day he refused to pay my ransom.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.41,1:45:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你全是为了石油吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was this all about the oil?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.25,1:45:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的石油\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my oil.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.89,1:45:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.06,1:45:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我家族的石油\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and my family's.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.62,1:45:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,流在我的血液里 比血还浓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It runs in my veins, thicker than blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.03,1:45:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要重新整合天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to redraw the map.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.66,1:45:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我完成后 整个世界都会知道我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I'm through, the whole world will know my name…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.17,1:45:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我外公的名字 我的族人的荣耀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my grandfather's name, the glory of my people!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.64,1:45:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会相信核爆是场意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will believe this meltdown was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.37,1:45:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定会相信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will all believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.61,1:45:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.68,1:45:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能抗拒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody can resist me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.39,1:45:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道被绞死的感觉吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what happens when a man is strangled?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.56,1:45:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还不迟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.80,1:45:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必害死八百万人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight million people need not die.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.37,1:46:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有机会时应该杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've killed me when you had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.14,1:46:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你下不了手 无法对我下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you couldn't. Not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.01,1:46:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法对你心爱的女人下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a woman you've loved.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.92,1:46:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你毫无感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You meant nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.69,1:46:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,再\N{\fnArial\fs30}One…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.96,1:46:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,转\N{\fnArial\fs30}…last…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.10,1:46:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}…screw.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.86,1:46:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.76,1:46:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.06,1:46:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.36,1:47:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.50,1:47:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找一艘潜艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for a sub.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.97,1:47:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘大大黑黑的 舰长是我老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's big and black, and the driver is a good friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.45,1:47:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.68,1:47:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.32,1:47:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚走不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.47,1:48:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的痛恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zukovsky really hated you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.80,1:48:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题了 你好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's under control up here. Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.41,1:48:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 该说晚安了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to say good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.61,1:48:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会冷血地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.15,1:48:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in cold blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.24,1:49:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call him off.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.49,1:49:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't ask again.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.39,1:49:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call him off.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.26,1:49:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快阻止他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call him off!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.80,1:49:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下不了手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.10,1:49:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没这么狠心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd miss me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.61,1:50:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快下潜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dive! Bond…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.12,1:50:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不心软\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.69,1:51:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.74,1:51:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为我忘了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I'd forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.21,1:52:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,下潜一百英尺后直航\N{\fnArial\fs30}Level at 100 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.58,1:52:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold her steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.39,1:52:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Level at 100 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.13,1:52:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要逼他们浮出水面\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can force them up to the surface…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.77,1:52:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜艇会被间谍卫星发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they'll show up on the spy satellite…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.00,1:52:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,海军就会赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…bring out the navy.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.11,1:52:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.78,1:52:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there. Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.32,1:52:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我过去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.75,1:52:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over there!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.02,1:53:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.49,1:53:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.49,1:53:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉平！拉平了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us level! Level!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.16,1:53:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,全被打烂了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all smashed!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.99,1:53:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉莫丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.53,1:53:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该笔直上升？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're going up then?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.49,1:53:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我稍微算错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slight miscalculation.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.34,1:53:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.58,1:53:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万要抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.83,1:54:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.43,1:54:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,进水了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's flooding!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.36,1:54:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快爬到上面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up to the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.57,1:54:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.11,1:55:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.47,1:55:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他启动反应炉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's opened up the reactor!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.04,1:55:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自己锁在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And locked himself in!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.84,1:55:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get up there to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.17,1:55:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have one chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.71,1:55:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要游到外面 再从逃生舱口进入反应炉室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get out and back in through the reactor room escape hatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.92,1:55:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,红灯一亮 就按下去让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the light goes red, press this button so I can get back in.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.55,1:55:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, it's too risky.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.22,1:55:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't make it…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.69,1:55:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就从这里逃生 关上舱门\N{\fnArial\fs30}…use this chamber to get out. Close the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.39,1:55:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路要吐气 关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exhale all the way up. Close it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.35,1:58:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.46,1:58:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.96,1:58:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要反应炉不爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're safe from the radiation…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.03,1:58:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就没有辐射线的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if the reactor coolant doesn't burst.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.00,1:58:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他把钸元素插进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he had gotten the plutonium rod in the reactor…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.91,1:58:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊斯坦堡就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we could've written off the whole city.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.51,1:59:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入我的核子家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to my nuclear family.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.11,1:59:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的愿意为她死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you really gonna commit suicide for her?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.78,1:59:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了 我早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forget, I'm already dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.48,1:59:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听说吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't you heard?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.55,1:59:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is she.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.59,1:59:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.19,1:59:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liar!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.43,1:59:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liar!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.78,2:01:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在地狱等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.63,2:01:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,氢气指数过高\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hydrogen gas level's too high.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.27,2:01:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要稍微有一点火花 反应炉就会爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}One spark and the reactor'll blow.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.67,2:01:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得想办法阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.91,2:01:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到上面的鱼雷发射孔等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the top of the sub. Meet me in the torpedo bay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.02,2:01:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,反应炉进水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reactor is flooded.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.42,2:01:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算爆炸也不会有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's safe even if this place blows.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.23,2:02:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这样不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's simply not the case.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.67,2:02:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before that.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.38,2:02:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有消息吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any word?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.21,2:02:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still no contact.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.18,2:02:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想在土耳其过圣诞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always wanted to have Christmas in Turkey.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.09,2:03:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在笑我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that a Christmas joke?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.82,2:03:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我笑你？不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From me? No.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.26,2:03:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.09,2:03:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,该是你拆礼物的时候了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So isn't it time you unwrapped your present?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.70,2:03:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.97,2:03:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.44,2:03:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 定位晶片 - 他一定在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The card. - He must be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.27,2:03:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.51,2:03:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪儿？- 这侦测到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - It picks up…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.95,2:03:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,体温 人体是橘色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…body heat, so humans come out orange.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.38,2:03:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.55,2:03:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你说他跟 琼斯博士在一起？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said he was with Dr. Jones?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.13,2:03:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越红了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting redder.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.31,2:04:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是千禧虫在作祟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be a premature form of the millennium bug.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.35,2:04:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong about you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.02,2:04:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How so?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.89,2:04:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为圣诞节一年只有一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Christmas only comes once a year.
